:name: CH32V003-like RV32EC board (hand-written platform)
:description: Loads ch32v003.repl (RV32EC + STM32F1-style USART1/GPIO) and the demo firmware.
$elf?=$ex_out/ch32v003_hello.elf

using sysbus
mach create "ch32v003"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/ch32v003.repl
showAnalyzer usart1
macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset
